:: Maras Secret
"You want to know about the lights?" Mara's expression darkens. "I've lived in Thornwood my whole life. The lights started a month ago. First faint, then brighter. They come from the direction of the old Keep."

She pauses. "My husband, Roderick, died in the forest thirty years ago. He was searching for... something. An old artifact. I told him not to go. He didn't listen."

"The lights and the artifact -- I think they're connected. If you can find whatever my husband was looking for, maybe we can end this."

But she's clearly holding something back. Her eyes don't quite meet yours.

